  "usage_note": "Latvian names are adapted in Lithuanian sports press. The Latvian -s ending is replaced with Lithuanian -as, and ļ is simplified to l (Merzļikins → Merzlikinas). This follows the same pattern as Porziņģis → Porzingis. Elvis declines like a Lithuanian -is noun (Elvio, Elviui). In running copy, the surname is usually used alone: Merzlikinas, Merzlikino."
